{"id":1177,"date":"2019-07-19T17:37:39","date_gmt":"2019-07-19T17:37:39","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/womglobal.com\/?post_type=product&#038;p=1177"},"modified":"2020-12-09T10:47:45","modified_gmt":"2020-12-09T06:47:45","slug":"magnum-subsea-hydraulic-actuator","status":"publish","type":"product","link":"https:\/\/womgroup.com\/product\/magnum-subsea-hydraulic-actuator\/","title":{"rendered":"Magnum Subsea Hydraulic Actuator"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">WOM\u2019s Subsea Hydraulic Actuator features a single-acting actuator with a true fail-safe spring return. Available in both fail-open or fail-close configurations to match pressure control requirements and customer applications.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"> WOM\u2019s Magnum Subsea Hydraulic Actuator has single-forged unitized top cap and cylinder for simple in-line maintenance. Quick disconnect mechanism allows for fast removal of actuator without breaking the body\/bonnet connection, providing immediate access to the stem packing. <\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"womtitle wp-block-heading\"> Specification and Features <\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>\u201cTrue\u201d Fail-Safe: <\/strong>WOM\u2019s Subsea Hydraulic Actuator features a single-acting actuator with a true fail-safe spring return. Available in both fail-open or fail-close configurations to match pressure control requirements and customer applications<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Hassle-free Maintenance:&nbsp;<\/strong> WOM\u2019s Magnum Subsea Hydraulic Actuator has single-forged unitized top cap and cylinder for simple in-line maintenance. Quick disconnect mechanism allows for fast removal of actuator without breaking&nbsp;the body\/bonnet connection, providing immediate access to the stem packing<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>nmatched Reliability: <\/strong>WOM\u2019s Magnum Subsea Hydraulic Actuator is capable of&nbsp;operating under&nbsp;harsh deepwater conditions&nbsp;for years without maintenance. Designed, built and test to API 6A &amp; 17D guidelines, the Magnum subsea actuator is one of the most reliable actuators in the industry<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"womtitle wp-block-heading\">Applications<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The Magnum Subsea Hydraulic Actuator&nbsp;design has been tested to a water depth of 13,200 and meets all specifications for subsea wellhead and Christmas tree applications.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><li>API rated for pressures from 2,000 to 20,000 PSI<\/li><li>Compatible with valves sized from 1-13\/16\u201d through 7-3\/8\u201d<\/li><li>Pressure equalization system is available (0 PSI&nbsp;differential pressure)<\/li><li>Compatible with anti-explosive decompression seals and energized non-elastomeric lip seals<\/li><li>ROV override optional<\/li><\/ul>\n","protected":false},"featured_media":1178,"template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"site-sidebar-layout":"default","site-content-layout":"default","ast-site-content-layout":"default","site-content-style":"default","site-sidebar-style":"default","ast-global-header-display":"","ast-banner-title-visibility":"","ast-main-header-display":"","ast-hfb-above-header-display":"","ast-hfb-below-header-display":"","ast-hfb-mobile-header-display":"","site-post-title":"disabled","ast-breadcrumbs-content":"","ast-featured-img":"disabled","footer-sml-layout":"","ast-disable-related-posts":"","theme-transparent-header-meta":"default","adv-header-id-meta":"","stick-header-meta":"default","header-above-stick-meta":"","header-main-stick-meta":"","header-below-stick-meta":"","astra-migrate-meta-layouts":"default","ast-page-background-enabled":"default","ast-page-background-meta":{"desktop":{"background-color":"","background-image":"","background-repeat":"repeat","background-position":"center center","background-size":"auto","background-attachment":"scroll","background-type":"","background-media":"","overlay-type":"","o